                                                "example_id": "04d89882-5dc8-456b-843f-96e7060dfb96",
                                                "sense_id": "40a5b00a-8e1a-3816-bdbb-c88cd4431aac",
                                                "text": "Across Ukraine, the initial shock over the confrontation, which culminated in President Donald Trump summarily dismissing Mr. Zelenskyy from the White House as if he were some ungrateful mendicant, has subsided."
                                            }
                                        ]
